WEBVTT

00:00:00.910 --> 00:00:01.910
The small things.

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:06.790
Things start to fade away when you have an experience where the ego dissolves, you step

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:08.830
into the spiritual realm.

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:11.750
One time I remember saying like, I was just like dancing in the ethers.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:17.030
Like I, you know, I just was living up here and you know, people have gone and met their

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.510
spirit team or met connected people who, you know, pass on the other side and there's

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:28.830
this more expansive oneness experience so that when you return these human things

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:33.430
that we grip, these small things just feel so insignificant.

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:39.190
And that's that remembering that, you know, when we're doing hypnosis or past life regression

00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:44.270
that you're able to access that and it's that felt sense of feeling it where we don't

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:49.790
have the language to really speak so as eloquently as we want to what that experience looks

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:54.310
like or feels like, but it is a gift when you tap into it.
